OL,3,GNEWSAFirst minister has not received
OL,4,Apolice letter over Garvaghy Road
OL,5,Aprotests
OL,6,
OL,7,FFirst Minister Michelle O'Neill has
OL,8,Fsaid she has not yet received a letter
OL,9,Ffrom police investigating protests over
OL,10,Fthe Drumcree parading dispute.
OL,12,FOn Thursday, the police said they had
OL,13,Fbegun issuing letters inviting people
OL,14,F"reasonably suspected" of committing
OL,15,Foffences linked to the protests to
OL,16,Finterview.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
