OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAFirst minister has not received
OL,4,Apolice letter over Garvaghy Road
OL,5,Aprotests
OL,6,
OL,7,FUnionist politicians have called for
OL,8,Faction to be taken against O'Neill and
OL,9,Fother senior Sinn Fein politicians who
OL,10,Ftook part in the protests against the
OL,11,FOrange Order march down the Garvaghy
OL,12,FRoad at the end of last month.
OL,14,FO'Neill has previously defended her
OL,15,Fattendance, saying she was "proud to
OL,16,Fstand with the residents" and that
OL,17,F"when the law is wrong, I will stand
OL,18,Ffirmly against it".
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
